h=1.5;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_fact_performance_reviews__department_sk" target="r_dim_department__department_sk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_fact_performance_reviews__date_sk" target="r_dim_date__date_sk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_fact_performance_reviews__project_sk" target="r_dim_project__project_sk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#ffe6cc;border:1px solid #d79b00&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Fact table&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#dae8fc;border:1px solid #6c8ebf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Dimension table&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #666666&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; ETL metadata (not part of the star)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FFF4D6;border:1px solid #B9770E&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Type 2 attribute (change creates a new version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background:#FBE3E3;border:1px solid #B85450&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; SCD Type 2 control column&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary (surrogate) key · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NK&lt;/b&gt; natural key from OLTP · &lt;b&gt;DD&lt;/b&gt; degenerate dimension&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;M&lt;/b&gt; measure · &lt;b&gt;T1&lt;/b&gt; Type 1 attribute (overwritten)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;T2&lt;/b&gt; Type 2 attribute · &lt;b&gt;SCD&lt;/b&gt; version control · &lt;b&gt;AUD&lt;/b&gt; audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GEN&lt;/b&gt; generated column (computed by MySQL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NULL&lt;/b&gt; optional column (all others NOT NULL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Crow's foot:&lt;/b&gt; || exactly one · o&amp;lt; zero or many" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="860" width="410" height="340" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Star schema rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Grain&lt;/b&gt;: one fact row per performance review (one employee in one review year).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;SCD Type 2&lt;/b&gt; (dim_employee): a change in any &lt;b&gt;T2&lt;/b&gt; column expires the current version (end_date = change date − 1, is_current = 0) and inserts a new one (end_date = 9999-12-31, is_current = 1). &lt;b&gt;T1&lt;/b&gt; columns overwrite every version.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Point-in-time lookup&lt;/b&gt;: fact.employee_sk = the version where review_date BETWEEN start_date AND end_date.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Special member&lt;/b&gt;: dim_project.project_sk = −1 “No Project Assigned” (natural key project_id = 0). All other foreign keys are mandatory; failed lookups go to etl_rejected_rows, never to a fake key.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Surrogate keys&lt;/b&gt;: signed INT AUTO_INCREMENT; date_sk = YYYYMMDD.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No PII&lt;/b&gt; (email, phone) in the warehouse." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="650" width="410" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>